<title>USA: National Energy sets $100 mln note sale.</title>
<headline>National Energy sets $100 mln note sale.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Energy Group Inc said it intends to offer $100 million principal amount of 10 year, senior notes in the near future as a private placement.</p>
<p>Noting the notes will not be registered with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, it said they may not be offered or sold in the United States.</p>
<p>If the sale is made, proceeds of the offering will be used to repay borrowings under its existing credit facility and to fund oil and natural gas exploitation, development, exploration and acquisition projects.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
